@node "history" "History"

@{b}V2.2 (December 2024)@{ub}

  - Fixed misaligned memory accesses (only affected 68000/68010 CPUs).

@{b}V2.1 (April 2022)@{ub}

  - Now parses Function Extension tuples (network function only).
  - Added a new PCCARD_Exponent tag to timing data as an alternative to
    the PCCARD_Scale tag.
  - Fixed parsing of the Device tuple.
  - Fixed various bugs in the parsing of Configuration Table Entry tuples.
  - Fixed a bug in PCCard_GetTupleInfo()'s handling of out-of-memory errors.

@{b}V1.1 (January 2003)@{ub}

  - First release.

@endnode


